4?t=1724984840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Upgrade your class through <strong>40 levels</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Passives</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540810/extras/fc9a9f2bd3919dd59d8f01ee63a45c9b.poster.avif?t=1724984840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540810/extras/fc9a9f2bd3919dd59d8f01ee63a45c9b.webm?t=1724984840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540810/extras/fc9a9f2bd3919dd59d8f01ee63a45c9b.mp4?t=1724984840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Select from a variety of <strong>12</strong> distinct passives to enhance your abilities throughout the battle, with the option to have 3 active simultaneously.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leaderboards</h2>Can you secure the top spot and become a true legend? Let your name shine on the global stage of Nyran Survivors! The game lists the top 100 players' rating per map.<br><br><i>* uses a logged in Discord account</i>",
